.\" Man page for gsr-ui-cli
.TH GSR-UI-CLI 1 "2026-06-03" "gpu-screen-recorder-ui" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gsr-ui-cli \- command-line interface for gsr-ui
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gsr-ui-cli
.I command
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gsr-ui-cli
is the command-line application to control
.B gsr-ui
without using \fBgsr-ui\fR's own hotkeys.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B --help, -h
Show help message.
.TP
.B toggle-show
Show/hide the UI.
.TP
.B toggle-record
Start/stop regular recording.
.TP
.B toggle-pause
Pause/unpause recording (only applies to regular recording).
.TP
.B toggle-record-region
Start/stop recording a region.
.TP
.B toggle-record-window
Start/stop recording a window (or desktop portal on Wayland).
.TP
.B toggle-stream
Start/stop streaming.
.TP
.B toggle-replay
Start/stop replay.
.TP
.B replay-save
Save the current replay.
.TP
.B replay-save-1-min
Save a replay of the last 1 minute.
.TP
.B replay-save-10-min
Save a replay of the last 10 minutes.
.TP
.B take-screenshot
Take a screenshot.
.TP
.B take-screenshot-region
Take a screenshot of a selected region.
.TP
.B take-screenshot-window
Take a screenshot of a window (or desktop portal on Wayland).
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B gsr-ui-cli toggle-show
Show or hide the main window.
.TP
.B gsr-ui-cli toggle-record
Start or stop screen recording.
